{"4632730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Breakaway", "steam_appid": 4632730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4833200], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632730/extras/45a38160bdc8fdf6b55fc86fc9337a97.avif?t=1788308030\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632730/extras_big/45a38160bdc8fdf6b55fc86fc9337a97.avif?t=1788308030 width=1560 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Overview</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>Breakaway <i>(alpha)</i></strong> blends tight, physics-based gameplay with unprecedented simulations of <u>world-class ball control</u> in the fairest game of football (<i>soccer</i>) ever made. Although now in its Early Access form, <i>Breakaway</i> <strong>currently</strong> has an array of features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic ball physics and control <i>(including Magnus effect aka </i><strong><i><u>curl</u></i></strong><i>)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the ball like never before simulated - <strong>juggle</strong> or flick the ball like a pro</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop shots as <u>goalkeeper</u>, but watch your stamina or you'll drop the ball!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <u><strong>offline</strong></u> <strong>or</strong> <u><strong>online</strong></u> (1v1-6v6) in public or private lobbies with <i>Bots Mode</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Intelligent bots</u> automatically fill in necessary positions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the difficulty &amp; match length, or play in slow motion!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>AFKbot</i> system when you abandon your post at BOTCORP</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice in <i>Training Mode</i> and <u>spawn objects</u> - bots, balls, mini goals, cones, + walls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 3 <u>unique fields</u> set in a futuristic dystopia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a <u>controller</u> or keyboard &amp; mouse, in <u>first</u> <i><strong>or</strong></i> <u>third person</u>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully remappable inputs &amp; many settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Breakaway</i> original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in 12 languages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Cloud support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No refs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632730/extras/17d9d62d83798b4f7897b6b68557ae71.avif?t=1788308030\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632730/extras_big/17d9d62d83798b4f7897b6b68557ae71.avif?t=1788308030 width=1560 height=314 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Future Planned Updates</u> </strong>-- / <i>assuming sustainable success /</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression and item unlocks (hats, balls, players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split-screen multiplayer, quick match, ranked</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New game modes (1-goal, survival, 11v11)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization of player, ball, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match mutators (ball type, gravity, player movement, etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded movement &amp; ball system (slide tackles, ball roll, bicycle kick, knuckleball)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extended ball &amp; movement feedback: visual and haptic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extended <i>Breakaway </i>OST &amp; more maps!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linux, Android, etc. support (with crossplay)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Deck compatibility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Official VR support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632730/extras/a00d4f687388324e1cf54e459761e349.avif?t=1788308030\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632730/extras_big/a00d4f687388324e1cf54e459761e349.avif?t=1788308030 width=1560 height=426 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>About</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breakaway is the product of a solo dev's love for the sport &amp; obsession with video games. Refined, fair, &amp; fun gameplay is the aim, and community feedback will be essential in order to refine Breakaway in the best ways for years to come. Micro-transactions, DRM, and so-called AI &quot;<i>art</i>&quot; are explicitly not a part of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632730/extras/b4163ef61939f5e7579667478831ccce.webp?t=1788308030\" width=35 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632730/extras/e43db3931afc9b78c324842f5f1bfd04.avif?t=1788308030\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632730/extras_big/e43db3931afc9b78c324842f5f1bfd04.avif?t=1788308030 width=1560 height=426 /></span></p><p c